# Gmail Configuration for Contact Form
# 
# To set up email sending:
# 1. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 2. Select "Mail" and "Windows Computer" (or your device)
# 3. Google will generate a 16-character app password
# 4. Copy the password and paste it below (remove spaces)
#
# These variables should also be added to your Vercel project settings:
# - Go to your Vercel project dashboard
# - Settings > Environment Variables
# - Add these variables for production deployment

GMAIL_USER=teddymara4@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_16_character_app_password_here
